{"series":{"id":"i-am-yingtai","slug":"i-am-yingtai","title":"I Am Yingtai","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-07/upscalemedia-transformed_0.jpeg?itok=Eh2Ohdfg","synopsis":"Una joven campesina, bendecida con una fuerza fuera de lo común, llega a la ciudad decidida a enfrentar un mundo repleto de desafíos. Pronto descubre que es la tercera generación de herederos de una antigua secta mística. Al ingresar en una academia de élite, busca formarse y erradicar la corrupción que la rodea. Pero su vida da un giro inesperado cuando asesinos de un país enemigo irrumpen en el palacio. Sin dudarlo, toma el mando junto a su equipo, enfrentando la amenaza con audacia y dejando claro que su fuerza y determinación no tienen igual.","status":"En Emisión","year":2025,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/i-am-yingtai"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.576Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"i-am-yingtai-t1","slug":"i-am-yingtai-t1","seriesId":"i-am-yingtai","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-07/upscalemedia-transformed_0.jpeg?itok=Eh2Ohdfg","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.576Z","episodeCount":12}],"episodes":[{"id":"i-am-yingtai-t1-e12","slug":"i-am-yingtai-t1-e12","title":"i-am-yingtai-1-episodio-x12","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/i-am-yingtai-1-episodio-x12","servers":[{"name":"rumble.com","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v6wrmvi/?pub=4m2typ","embed":true},{"name":"geo.dailymotion.com","url":"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player.html?video=k4tgWJlGHrHYwcDQrwU","embed":true}],"seriesId":"i-am-yingtai","seasonId":"i-am-yingtai-t1","number":12,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:26:06.179Z"},{"id":"i-am-yingtai-t1-e10","slug":"i-am-yingtai-t1-e10","title":"i-am-yingtai-1-episodio-x10","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/i-am-yingtai-1-episodio-x10","servers":[{"name":"rumble.com","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v6w5234/?pu